1
00:00:00,519 --> 00:00:02,019
...to Erwin Schrödinger...

2
00:00:02,187 --> 00:00:05,687
(Sheldon:)...to the Dutch researchers
that Leonard is currently ripping off.

3
00:00:07,317 --> 00:00:09,857
-Twenty-six hundred years?
-Yeah, give or take.

4
00:00:10,028 --> 00:00:15,278
(Sheldon:)As I was saying, it's a warm summer
evening in ancient Greece--

5
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:18,080
(Sheldon:)-Yes, Penny.
-I have to go to the bathroom.

6
00:00:18,245 --> 00:00:22,035
(Sheldon:)-Can't you hold it?
-Not for 2600 years.

7
00:00:31,633 --> 00:00:34,303
SHELDON:
Project Gorilla, entry two.

8
00:00:34,469 --> 00:00:36,929
(Sheldon:)I am exhausted.

9
00:00:53,071 --> 00:00:54,451
(Sheldon:)-Howard?
-Uh-- Huh?

10
00:00:54,614 --> 00:00:56,654
(Bernadette:)It unhooks in the front.

11
00:00:57,284 --> 00:01:02,024
(Howard:)Oh, that explains a lot.

